    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52423" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰκό-φρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρήν</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ill-minded, malignant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραπίδων καρπός</span>”
