					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					211
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				372
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				744
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ</span>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέριμνα</span>]<i><span class="en">
